<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1908</h1><p class="ref-lede">1908 in world history: 27 events, 23 births, 24 deaths, 3 works, 2 states founded and 3 that came to an end. 765 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
